{"unit":{"id":"l2-u50","level":2,"order":92,"title":"Unit 50","wordIds":["w:快要","w:东方","w:常见","w:商人","w:少数","w:走过","w:得出","w:起飞","w:网球","w:停车场","w:大海","w:做饭"],"grammarIds":["g:changjian-common","g:kuaiyao-le-soon"],"sentenceIds":["s:l2:289","s:l2:290","s:l2:291","s:l2:292","s:l2:353","s:l2:354","s:l2:355","s:l2:356"]},"grammar":[{"id":"g:changjian-common","title":"Commonly seen things with 常见","pattern":"常见 + noun","explanation":"常见 (chángjiàn) means \"common, commonly seen\" describing something frequently encountered, usually placed before a noun.","level":2,"sentenceIds":["s:l2:353","s:l2:354","s:l2:355","s:l2:356"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"g:kuaiyao-le-soon","title":"Coming up soon: 快要...了","pattern":"快要 + verb + 了","explanation":"快要...了 (kuàiyào...le) means \"about to happen, soon\" very similar to 就要...了, and often used for natural changes like weather or time passing.","level":2,"sentenceIds":["s:l2:289","s:l2:290","s:l2:291","s:l2:292"],"unitId":"l2-u50"}],"sentences":[{"id":"s:l2:289","zh":"飞机快要起飞了。","pinyin":"Fēijī kuàiyào qǐfēi le.","en":"The plane is about to take off.","wordIds":["w:飞机","w:快要","w:起飞","w:了"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:290","zh":"天快要黑了。","pinyin":"Tiān kuàiyào hēi le.","en":"It's about to get dark.","wordIds":["w:天","w:快要","w:黑","w:了"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:291","zh":"我们快要到了。","pinyin":"Wǒmen kuàiyào dào le.","en":"We're almost there.","wordIds":["w:我们","w:快要","w:到","w:了"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:292","zh":"冬天快要来了。","pinyin":"Dōngtiān kuàiyào lái le.","en":"Winter is coming soon.","wordIds":["w:冬天","w:快要","w:来","w:了"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:353","zh":"这是一个常见的问题。","pinyin":"Zhè shì yí gè chángjiàn de wèntí.","en":"This is a common problem.","wordIds":["w:这","w:是","w:一","w:个","w:常见","w:的","w:问题"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:354","zh":"这是很常见的病。","pinyin":"Zhè shì hěn chángjiàn de bìng.","en":"This is a very common illness.","wordIds":["w:这","w:是","w:很","w:常见","w:的","w:病"],"unitId":"l2-u50"},{"id":"s:l2:355","z